OL,13,     FPresenters Rick Edwards and Ortis
OL,14,     FDelay are out with the police
OL,15,     Finterceptors as they tackle the
OL,16,     Fdifficult night shift.
OL,17,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FIn this special episode, the
OL,19,     Finterceptor's take on the young
OL,20,     Fand reckless who cause carnage on
OL,21,     Four roads and put themselves and
OL,22,     Fothers in danger.
