OL,5,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,6,     FAt a limestone quarry in
OL,7,     FYorkshire, hauliers are tasked
OL,8,     Fwith moving a pair of stone
OL,9,     Fcrushers, each weighing over
OL,10,     F70-tonnes. In Southampton, a boat
OL,11,     Fhaulier team prepare a survey
OL,12,     Fvessel.
OL,13,G0300 Trucking Heavy
OL,14,     FSmurf and Ian travel to the
OL,15,     FScottish Highlands to move a
OL,16,     F110-tonne metal drum used for
OL,17,     Findustrial paper drying, and in
OL,18,     FChester a 5-tonne freezer unit
OL,19,     Fneeds shifting to the race course.
